  "question": {
    "text": "Phosphorus pentachloride dissociates as follows, in a closed reaction vessel, $\\mathrm{PCl}_5(\\mathrm{~g}) \\rightleftharpoons \\mathrm{PCl}_3(\\mathrm{~g})+\\mathrm{Cl}_2(\\mathrm{~g})$\nIf total pressure at equilibrium of the reaction mixture is $\\mathrm{P}$ and degree of dissociation of $\\mathrm{PCl}_5$ is $\\mathrm{x}$, the partial pressure of $\\mathrm{PCl}_3$ will be",
